Subject: [PATCH] net: add QCA multicast snooper and ECM route hooks for Linux 6.18

Adapt qosmio/openwrt-ipq 92a2d104145c8d265851c4b388a41bd8e9c21cd9,
patches-6.12/0604-1-qca-add-mcs-support.patch. Preserve the Linux 6.18
FDB fallback and multicast policy paths. Serialize callback registration,
protect cache readers with RCU and notify deletes before releasing caches,
including multicast-table flushes and VIF removal. ECM callbacks cover
init_net/default tables.

